  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ぷ、プロデューサー！　大変なんだ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "秋山 隼人"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_f:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ちょうどいいところに！　実は皆さんの\nライブ動画が突然、桁違いに伸びていまして……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_f:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それそれ！　まさかのスミスっち本人が見て、\nSNSで反応してるんすよ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊瀬谷 四季"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_f:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ええ！？　スミスっちって、\nARROW・Bのご本人がですか！？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_f:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "まあ、反応って言っても『日本の子供が、\nSOクール！　HAHAHA！』的な感じだけど……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "若里 春名"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_f:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それでも世界的アーティストの反応は凄いですよ！\n今もほら、再生数が上がり続けてますし……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "冬美 旬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_f:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……返事、しなくていいの？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "榊 夏来"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_f:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "たしかに！　スミスさんにお礼をしないと！\nお返事の動画を撮りましょう！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_f:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……よ、よし。スミスさん！\n動画を見てくれて、ありがとうございます！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "秋山 隼人"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_f:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "スミスさんのこと、ずっと尊敬してて……\nその、なので、すごく嬉しかったです！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "秋山 隼人"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_f:step-22:text",
        "step_id": 22,
        "step_index": 21,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 21
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "え？　日本語？\nここはやっぱ、英語のほうがよくないっすか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊瀬谷 四季"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_f:step-25:text",
        "step_id": 25,
        "step_index": 24,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 24
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "シキ、英語が話せるようになったの……？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "榊 夏来"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_03_f:step-26:text",
        "step_id": 26,
        "step_index": 25,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_03_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_03_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 25
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "もち！　イェーイ！\nスミスっち、ギガサンキューっす！！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊瀬谷 四季"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
